00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,060
CONVERSATION 1
I must say, I love our canteen!

2
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,200
It's such a great meeting point!

3
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,940
Yeah, it really is, both for students and teachers.

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,280
Shame about the food.

5
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,220
What do you mean?

6
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:51,140
I think the food is fine.

7
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:55,400
I would say the food is just OK, but the prices are absurd.

8
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,540
Don't you agree?

9
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,080
I don't, actually.

10
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:01,520
I personally think they're perfectly appropriate.

11
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:06,320
If it's overpriced, why does it get so frantically busy at lunchtimes?

12
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:08,860
Hmm, you make a good point.

13
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:12,820
I guess a lot of it is good value, maybe even most of it.

14
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:19,060
However, don't you think 6 bucks for a slice of apple crumble is beyond most students' budgets?

15
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:21,480
Um, yes, desserts are overpriced.

16
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,840
I'll give you that.

17
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:26,300
To be honest, I've forgotten about those, as I never eat them.

18
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:31,940
I never really crave sweet things or any fancy delicacies.

19
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:35,080
What I always go for is their scrambled eggs.

20
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:37,680
They have such a great variety.

21
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,700
Yeah, those are good.

22
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,120
They also come out really fast.

23
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:46,660
Actually, that's one of the best things about the canteen - the speed.

24
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:54,420
If I fancy something more substantial than a sandwich, but I don't have much time for lunch, the university canteen is always a good option.

25
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:58,080
The kitchen staff work at such a brisk pace.

26
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,840
They really deserve to be complimented for it.

27
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:04,020
Totally, and it's such a great environment too.

28
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,560
Like the entire building is beautiful.

29
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,860
It is very nice.

30
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:10,800
The massive glass windows make all the difference.

31
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,580
I think they're so cool.

32
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:16,040
Apparently, they did a massive renovation a few years ago.

33
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,940
It cost them a pretty penny.

34
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,320
Yeah, I'm not surprised.

35
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:23,560
It's a very versatile space, suitable both for eating and relaxing.

36
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,260
And for working.

37
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:27,400
You're right, working too.

38
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,820
I've used my laptop there once or twice.

39
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:40,480
And there's always a group project or meeting going on at the far end.

40
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:58,660
Q1. What does the woman say about the food at the canteen?

41
00:02:58,660 --> 00:03:18,640
Q2. How does the woman feel about the canteen's sweet things or fancy delicacies?

42
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:37,240
Q3. What does the man say is one of the best things about the canteen?

43
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:55,800
Q4. What did the canteen undergo a few years ago?

